				<Item class="StringValue" referent="RIFT_CUSTOM_3306">
					<Properties>
						<string name="Value">Models: place a connected R15 rig under CharacterModels, named aizen, ui_goku, etc. VFX: copy Templates/EffectPart into VFX/&lt;id&gt;, name it Q, E, R, M1 or Hit. Config holds sounds, icons, economy and admin IDs. See CUSTOMIZE_ME.md in the project ZIP.</string>
