					<Item class="StringValue" referent="RIFT_CUSTOM_3569">
						<Properties>
							<string name="Value">Select an Animation and edit AnimationId to rbxassetid://YOUR_ID. Default applies to everyone; character folders override it. Blank uses default. Use animations compatible with your rig, uploaded by the experience owner/group or permitted for this experience. M1/Q/E/R play on accepted attacks in duels. Idle/Walk/Run/Jump/Fall/Climb/Swim replace standard Animate slots. Re-equip or respawn to apply movement edits.</string>
