					<Item class="StringValue" referent="RIFT_CUSTOM_3212">
						<Properties>
							<string name="Value">Select a character Sound and set SoundId to rbxassetid://YOUR_AUDIO_ID. Edit Volume or PlaybackSpeed if desired. It plays locally when that character appears after the box opens, including duplicate rolls and owner grants. Blank SoundId uses the standard reward chime. KEEP IT stops the sound. Clips are capped at 30 seconds and use the global UI.SoundVolume multiplier. Use audio permitted for your experience.</string>
